    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINIGAMES AND FLYING?</strong></h2><br>In FAILURE TO LAUNCH, complete difficult minigames while also SIMULTANEOUSLY piloting a spaceship through an endless runner of obstacles. Danger is everywhere commander!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641590/extras/19cb984fa00212823f6c219f723f1806.poster.avif?t=1702007992\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641590/extras/19cb984fa00212823f6c219f723f1806.webm?t=1702007992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641590/extras/19cb984fa00212823f6c219f723f1806.mp4?t=1702007992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAILURE IS AN OPTION</strong></h2><br>Fail a minigame or hit an obstacle, and your ship will meet a FIERY EXPLOSION. Are you skilled enough to drive and finish minigames AT THE SAME TIME? This game will put you to the multi tasking test! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641590/extras/ea140cc4643426936167b71f8c26bee4.poster.avif?t=1702007992\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641590/extras/ea140cc4643426936167b71f8c26bee4.webm?t=1702007992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641590/extras/ea140cc4643426936167b71f8c26bee4.mp4?t=1702007992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BONUS FEATURES APLENTY</strong></h2><br>With weekly Leaderboard seasons, an Unlock Tree, Achievements, and over 30 whacky unlockable ships, backgrounds and ship trails, there are 